ga6o(){return"## Publisher\nThe ClubPulse MAFA app is published for Martial Art Fighter Academy (MAFA), Canada.\n\nClubPulse MAFA is Martial Art Fighter Academy's edition of ClubPulse, a ClubPulse by K3CH solution.\n\nHead office: [address to be completed], [city, province], Canada.\nBusiness number (NEQ / BN): [to be completed].\nPublication manager: [name to be completed].\nContact: [academy email and phone to be completed].\n\n## Hosting\nApp data is hosted by Supabase Inc. (database, authentication and file storage) in the region chosen by the academy [to be specified, e.g. Canada (ca-central-1)].\n\n## Intellectual property\nThe MAFA name, logo and badge and the published content (texts, photos) belong to the academy or their authors. Any reproduction without written permission is prohibited. Partner logos remain the property of their owners.\n\n## Liability\nThe academy strives to keep information accurate (schedules, fees, events) but cannot guarantee it is error-free. Schedules and fees may change at any time."},
ga6r(){return"## Person in charge of personal information\nMartial Art Fighter Academy (MAFA) is responsible for protecting the personal information collected through ClubPulse MAFA, in accordance with the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA) and, in Quebec, Law 25. Person in charge: [name and email to be completed].\n\n## Data collected\nIdentity, contact details, date of birth, disciplines and groups, ranks, registration documents, attendance, declared payments and notification preferences.\n\n## Purposes\nMembership and registration management, class schedules, belt gradings, competitions and academy communications.\n\n## Retention\nData is kept during membership, then archived or deleted according to the academy's policy [period to be completed].\n\n## Your rights\nYou may request access, correction or deletion of your information, and withdraw consent, by writing to [email to be completed]. For minors, these rights are exercised by the parent or guardian."},
ga6z(){return"## Purpose\nThese terms of use govern the use of the ClubPulse MAFA app by visitors, members, parents, instructors and administrators of Martial Art Fighter Academy.\n\n## Account\nEach user is responsible for keeping their credentials confidential and for the accuracy of the information provided.\n\n## Use\nThe app supports academy life: registrations, schedules, ranks, competitions and communications. Misuse may lead to account suspension.\n\n## Governing law\nThese terms are governed by the laws of the province of [to be completed] and the applicable federal laws of Canada. Any dispute shall first be settled amicably."},
